# RUMPEL subagents

Project subagents live in `.cursor/agents/`. Prefer delegating or explicit `/name` invocation:

| Subagent | Use for |
| --- | --- |
| `/engine-architect` | `rumpel_world`, `rumpel_render`, meshing, chunks, FPS, shaders |
| `/gameplay-coder` | `rumpel_player`, ECS gameplay, UI, startup Lua mods |
| `/code-reviewer` | Independent review; `cargo check`, `test`, `clippy` (readonly) |
| `/game-designer` | `GDD.md`, `BOARD.md`, feature specs |
| `/art-director` | `assets/` textures and block visuals |

Built-in Cursor subagents (`explore`, `bash`, `browser`) remain available for search, shell, and browser.

Game Director: assign disjoint file ownership; do not revert unrelated edits.
